U-AVF license index — updated locally 2026-10-04

This repository has multiple licenses, not a blanket proprietary license.

1. Only original files explicitly listed in LICENSE_SCOPE.md are covered by
   LICENSE-UAVF.txt (U-AVF Source-Available License 1.0).
2. Previously Apache-2.0-licensed U-AVF material and other first-party files not
   expressly listed retain Apache-2.0; see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt. Earlier grants
   are not revoked. An unlisted file with its own license retains that license.
3. Third-party material retains its own licenses, regardless of location.
   See docs/release-preparation/THIRD_PARTY_COMPLIANCE.md and bundled notices.
4. Firmware, guest libraries, fonts and the Ubuntu ISO are NOT covered as a
   proprietary aggregate. Copyleft/source obligations remain applicable.
5. This index does not replace the component licenses or their notice/source obligations.
